diff --git a/docker/ralue/README.md b/docker/ralue/README.md
index 7994a758..160c98c2 100644
--- a/docker/ralue/README.md
+++ b/docker/ralue/README.md
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
-# Ralue Editor reproducible baseline
+# Ralue Editor reproducible build
 
 This build keeps the document engine byte-for-byte from the pinned upstream
 image and compiles the Online server and browser UI from the pinned source
@@ -9,6 +9,7 @@ commit in `UPSTREAM.lock`.
 - `ralue-upstream-26.04.2.4`: immutable upstream source before Ralue changes.
 - `ralue/mvp-editor`: working branch for the branded editor.
 - `ralue/editor:upstream-26.04.2.4`: locally compiled, unmodified baseline.
+- `ralue/editor:mvp-26.04.2.4`: branded MVP built from the tested baseline.
 
 ## Build and resume
 
@@ -22,6 +23,10 @@ Docker BuildKit caches downloads, npm dependencies, and completed build layers.
 If a stage fails, correct it and run the same command; completed stages are not
 rebuilt. A durable export of the cache is kept under `.build-progress/cache`.
 
+Browser assets use the hexadecimal Ralue revision `a1e2604001`, separate from the pinned
+upstream engine hash. Bump this revision for each deployable UI release so
+browsers never reuse bundles from an older editor build.
+
 To limit RAM usage, set an explicit job count:
 
 ```powershell
@@ -37,10 +42,21 @@ docker compose -f .\docker\ralue\compose.baseline.yml up -d
 The discovery endpoint is then available at
 `http://localhost:9982/hosting/discovery`.
 
+## Run the branded MVP
+
+```powershell
+docker compose -f .\docker\ralue\compose.yml up -d
+```
+
+The branded build uses the existing Ralue logo and favicon, reports itself as
+Ralue Editor, disables welcome/update/feedback and subscription upsells, and
+keeps the unrestricted non-home-mode connection behavior. Writer retains File,
+Home, Insert, Layout, Format, and contextual document tabs; review, references,
+forms, view, extensions, and help tabs are omitted from the default surface.
+
 ## Licensing boundary
 
 The upstream MPL-2.0 notices and source history stay intact. Ralue branding is
 applied only after this baseline passes its WOPI editing and save tests. Public
 distribution must include the corresponding modified source and must not use
 Collabora trademarks as the product identity.
-
